{"metadata":{"title":"Night at the Museum","author":"AI","language":"English","difficulty":"A2"},"content":[["The heavy doors","close quietly.","Leo stays","inside the museum.","He wants","to solve the mystery","of the missing painting.","The rooms","are dark","and completely silent."],["Suddenly","he hears footsteps.","Someone is walking","down the hall.","Leo hides","behind a marble statue.","A shadowy figure","holds the stolen art.","Leo jumps forward","and catches the thief."]]}